6. Breaking the terms

If you break any of these terms, your permission under this license ends automatically. It is
restored if you fix the problem within 30 days of first being told about it.


7. Other terms

Only the copyright holder can grant permission on terms other than these.

Third-party code included in the Software or its builds stays under its own license.
